# Rogue Encampment arrival with rain, cursor pinned: the draw list of server
# tick 73 with the pass-9 rain lines compared (no --skip-weather). A cursor
# move every 18 frames keeps the cursor's 5 s idle change, a wall-clock timer
# that steps the shared client seed, out of the run: with it the 1.14d rain
# lines repeat exactly (traces/pc1/rain-lines-a1-town-pin.tsv, ten runs).
